N        EQU   20
FK       EQU   13
FK1      EQU   8
FK2      EQU   5
KEY      EQU   1000
K        EQU   1200
         ORIG  3000
START    LDA   K           F1. Initialize.
         ENT1  FK          i ← Fk.
         ENT2  FK1-1       p ← Fk−1.
         ENT3  FK2-1       q ← Fk−2.
         JMP   F2A         To step F2.
F4A      INC1  1,3         F4. Increase i. i ← i + q.
         DEC2  1,3         p ← p − q.
         DEC3  1,2         q ← q − p.
F2A      CMPA  KEY,1       F2. Compare.
         JL    F3A         To F3 if K < Ki.
         JE    SUCCESS     Exit if K = Ki.
         J2NZ  F4A         To F4 if p ≠ 1.
         JMP   FAILURE     Exit if not in table.
F3A      DEC1  1,3         F3. Decrease i. i ← i − q.
         DEC2  1,3         p ← p − q.
         J3NN  F2B         Swap registers if q > 0.
         JMP   FAILURE     Exit if not in table.
F4B      INC1  1,2         (Lines 18–29 are parallel to 06–17.)
         DEC3  1,2
         DEC2  1,3
F2B      CMPA  KEY,1
         JL    F3B
         JE    SUCCESS
         J3NZ  F4B
         JMP   FAILURE
F3B      DEC1  1,2
         DEC3  1,2
         J2NN  F2A
         JMP   FAILURE
FAILURE  ENTA  0
         HLT
SUCCESS  ENTA  0,1
         HLT
         END   START
